<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>五脏生克 - 标签 - 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E4%BA%94%E8%84%8F%E7%94%9F%E5%85%8B/</link><description>观以明理，颐以养正</description><follow_challenge><feedId>150502341826627584</feedId><userId>ZnkTaajoold86nK1rOZmQsDmDM1cgXMP</userId></follow_challenge><generator>Hugo 0.161.1 &amp; FixIt v0.4.5</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Wed, 29 Apr 2026 17:07:22 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E4%BA%94%E8%84%8F%E7%94%9F%E5%85%8B/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>跟倪师学黄帝内经笔记之四：病变之因</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/suwen-zhibingzhiyin/</link><pubDate>Sun, 04 May 2025 20:14:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/suwen-zhibingzhiyin/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/">素问笔记</category><description>系统阐述了中医&amp;quot;天人相应&amp;quot;的发病观，指出人体疾病源于内外因交互作用：外因以六淫（风寒暑湿燥火）为主，内因包括情志失调、饮食失节、劳逸失度等，通过阴阳失衡、五行生克、六经传变等病理机制，表现为表里寒热虚实错杂的证候体系，其核心在于&amp;quot;正气存内，邪不可干&amp;quot;的发病原理，强调疾病发生发展具有时序性（四时病传）、层次性（由表入里）、相关性（五脏互传）三大规律，形成了一套涵盖六经辨证、八纲辨证、脏腑辨证的完整病理认知体系。</description></item><item><title>玉机真藏论篇第十九</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/suwen-19/</link><pubDate>Sat, 15 Feb 2025 20:14:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/suwen-19/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE/">素问</category><description>黄帝与岐伯通过问答形式，系统阐述了四季脉象（春弦、夏钩、秋浮、冬营）与五脏的对应关系，以及脉象太过、不及所对应的病症，强调脉诊需结合四时变化和胃气盛衰来判断疾病预后，并指出真脏脉现为死症，同时论述了病邪传变规律和治疗时机的重要性。</description></item></channel></rss>